Usage: hierarchy unset --child <ID>

Remove the native parent from one work item. Redmine writes an explicit null parent_issue_id; GitLab issues the Work Item hierarchy widget mutation with a null parent. Never touches relations and never closes the item. Orchestrator-only.

Update an issue
